/arcmid1 arcend1 arcstart1 add 2 div def 0 0 radius arcstart1 arcmid1
dsize width 1 dashcarc 0 0 radius arcmid1 arcend1 dsize width 1 dashcarc
arcmid1 rotate radius 0 translate arrowup grestore } def

